# 46
#title docs: add screenshots and a tour video to the README
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/46
#branch docs/readme-media
#base origin/main
#opened 2026-11-13
#head ec19e04d9eefd31b2b4565787ee6963eb0f8ee9d
#describe what Adds a 70 second tour (gif inline, mp4 linked) and six screenshots to the README, with a new Planning section.
#describe before The README described Lantern in text only and had no picture of the app.
#describe after The README shows the map, the macro view, a plan with a stage selected, a pull request flow and a diff review with the flow on.
#describe verified Captured from the e2e harness on synthetic data (Orchard Market, PRs 77 and 317) and looked at frame by frame; no real project, name or ticket shows.
#describe verified Only README.md and docs/assets/readme/ change; no code or test was touched.
