#reason docs/assets/readme/lantern-tour.gif Inline preview of the 70 second tour, because GitHub does not play an mp4 from the repository in a README.
#reason docs/assets/readme/lantern-tour.mp4 The full 70 second tour of the map, a plan, a pull request flow and a diff review, linked from the README.
#reason docs/assets/readme/map-files.png Screenshot of the project graph with the files of pull request 77 lit, on the synthetic Orchard Market project.
#reason docs/assets/readme/map-macro.png Screenshot of the macro view: one card per area, the shared foundation and the outside systems.
#reason docs/assets/readme/plan-stage.png Screenshot of a plan with stage s2 selected and the areas it changes marked on the macro view.
#reason docs/assets/readme/pr-flow.png Screenshot of a pull request flow in plain words, with the files that carry each step.
#reason docs/assets/readme/pr-review-diff.png Screenshot of a diff next to its reason, the changed-file list and the graph.
#reason docs/assets/readme/review-flow-code.png Screenshot of a diff with the flow on and the step the file belongs to highlighted beside the code.
#reason README.md Shows the tour and the screenshots right under What it does, with a Planning section and the flow on the review.
#story A visitor sees Lantern working before installing
#step actor A visitor
#step action opens the repository page and watches
#step subject the tour under What it does
